White numbers are for physical damage. \
Blue numbers are for magic damage. \
Red numbers indicate a crit! (magic damage can't crit)
Certain enemies will be resistant to either physical or magic damage, so be aware!
press 1 - switch to projectile (currently disabled)\
B - recall to hub world (currently useless)\
Shift - Dodge (2 sec cooldown)
1. Kill enemies and pick up EXP\
2. Once purple bar is full, the level-up menu will display\
3. choose an item and place it in your inventory. \
press I to close inventory\
4. Repeat step 1
